  "validity": "Genuine ReactOS _strlwr_nt.c and shipping cnt-rust _strlwr shim plus cstr_slice, raw_mut_slice and core_rs::casemap::lower_ascii. Inputs are non-null, ASCII, NUL-terminated byte strings; arbitrary ASCII including punctuation and embedded NUL is allowed because both implementations must stop at the first NUL. This grades ASCII-only in-place folding, preservation of all bytes after the first NUL, and returning the original pointer. Host behavior only.",
